All five are AssemblyVersion 6.6.0.0.

These are compile-time references only. Every <Reference> to them in
dnSpy-automate.csproj sets Private=false, so they are never copied into the build output
and never shipped with the extension: at run time the extension binds to the copies dnSpy
itself has already loaded. Nothing in this directory is redistributed by an installed
dnSpy-automate.

To compile against a different dnSpy version instead of these, point DNSPY_BIN_DIR (or
-p:DnSpyContractsDir=...) at that dnSpy's bin directory; lib/ is then ignored.
